WEBVTT

37:01.871 --> 37:04.457
Rakharo say you should take ear,
to teach respect.

37:04.582 --> 37:07.126
Please. Please, don't hurt him.

37:11.255 --> 37:15.051
Tell him I don't want my brother harmed.

37:15.843 --> 37:17.762
(SPEAKS DOTHRAKI)

37:17.887 --> 37:20.181
Huh?

37:21.182 --> 37:23.935
(SPEAKS DOTHRAKI)
(GASPING)

37:27.855 --> 37:31.359
Mormont! Kill these Dothraki dogs!
